  "SUSPENDED_TRUNCATED_ENCODER": {
    "status": "SUSPENDED - do not cite. The encoder was TRUNCATED, not the one named.",
    "why": "embed_ct.py loaded google/embeddinggemma-300m via transformers AutoModel + attention-mask mean pooling. EmbeddingGemma is a sentence-transformers model whose modules.json declares FIVE modules: Transformer -> Pooling -> 2_Dense(768->3072) -> 3_Dense(3072->768) -> 4_Normalize. AutoModel+meanpool executes modules 0 and 1 ONLY, silently skipping TWO TRAINED DENSE PROJECTION HEADS (2_Dense/ and 3_Dense/, 9.4MB of weights each, present on disk) and the final Normalize. Output has the right shape (768) and raises no error, so nothing looked wrong -- it is simply a different vector space from the one the model card describes.",
